 "remarks": "Welcome to 121 Leroy Ave, where classic comfort meets unbeatable convenience. Ideally located just moments from the bustling and recently redeveloped downtown Darien and express train to NYC, this beautifully maintained home offers the perfect blend of space, style, suburban tranquility, and access to the best of what Darien has to offer. Highlights of this classic colonial include four bedrooms, two full and one half bath, chef's kitchen, sunny open floorplan, and attached two-car garage. All four bedrooms, including the lovely primary suite, are on the second floor. Outdoor entertaining is a dream with your own beautifully landscaped and private half acre property and deck. An exceptional offering in a coveted location.",
